                "senderName": "NWS Fairbanks AK",
                "headline": "Winter Storm Warning issued November 25 at 9:54PM AKST until November 27 at 3:00PM AKST by NWS Fairbanks AK",
                "description": "* WHAT...Periods of blizzard conditions. Winds gusting as high as 45\nmph.\n\n* WHERE...Point Thompson.\n\n* WHEN...Until 3 PM AKST Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Areas of blowing snow could significantly reduce\nvisibility.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Very little additional falling snow is\nexpected. Strong winds will blow snow already on the ground to\ncreate areas of low visibility near the surface. No significant\nvisibility reductions are expected at Barter Island/Kaktovik due to\nopen water limiting the availability of blowable snow to the east.",
                "instruction": "If you must travel, keep an extra flashlight, food, and water in your\nvehicle in case of an emergency.",
